# Locale Policy

- **Chat with project owner:** Brazilian Portuguese (pt-BR).
- **All project artifacts in English:** source code, tests, comments, commit messages, PR titles/descriptions, `.specs/` documents, API docs, and identifier names (variables, functions, classes).

# Engineering Baseline

- Follow existing codebase conventions before introducing new patterns.
- Run tests and linters before considering work done.
- Never commit secrets, API keys, or credentials.
- Prefer small, focused diffs over large refactors.
- Apply secure coding practices from `.cursor/skills/engineering-standards.md`.
- Run security checklist from `.cursor/skills/security-review.md` during `/verify`.

